e event, you'll be sent back to the first round of East 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205000/extras/22d98afd658ba4a70b4f5266b51a2a55.avif?t=1758888287\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the &quot;Mahjong puzzle&quot; rounds, you\u2019ll be given specific conditions like &quot;win or draw to proceed.&quot; You'll need to make the appropriate calls and tile discards to meet the clear conditions and proceed. If you fail to meet the conditions, you'll also be sent back to East 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205000/extras/1a1c0946f3cda30055292a79d8851eac.avif?t=1758888287\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your Mahjong skills and aim for victory beyond the final round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: While there is a &quot;Strange Event Assist&quot; function, you will need to understand the basic rules of Mahjong for smooth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---About Streaming the Game---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and companies are allowed to post videos, stream, monetize, or create clips of the gameplay on video platforms. Please include &quot;Spoiler Alert&quot; in the thumbnail or title.</p>","developers":["YUTAMARO WORLD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205000/header.jpg?t=1758888287","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min